Breadslicer hollowing engine
============================

Written for Breadslicer by SynrgStudio. MIT licensed (see COPYING).

Earlier versions of this crate were a port of the voxel hollowing engine of
DragonFruit (Open Resin Alliance and contributors, MIT licensed,
https://github.com/Open-Resin-Alliance/DragonFruit). That port has been
replaced: the voxelization, distances, cavity contour, infill, mesh, ray
tree and edge checks are this crate's own. The drain cut (src/drain.rs) and
the engine interface (src/engine.rs) were written by SynrgStudio for the
SoulCrafted Slicer; the interface keeps the shape of the settings it was
first written against. COPYING keeps the MIT notice of the original port for
those parts.

Breadslicer is AGPL-3.0; MIT code is compatible with it.
No code from Lychee or any other closed slicer is included.
